+Media sources
+=============
+
+- `hero-coffee.mp4`: [A Person Pouring Coffee on the Cup, Ketut Subiyanto / Pexels](https://www.pexels.com/video/a-person-pouring-coffee-on-the-cup-4392069/).
+- `coffee-roasting.mp4`: [Roasting Coffee Beans / Pexels](https://www.pexels.com/video/roasting-coffee-beans-7174275/).
+- Videos are resized, compressed, and stripped of audio. Posters are still frames from the corresponding stock videos. Footage is illustrative, not footage of The Daily Grind's facilities.
+- Stock footage is provided under the [Pexels license](https://www.pexels.com/license/).
+- `morning-ritual.mp3`: original mini episode, synthesized locally with FFmpeg's Flite `slt` voice. `morning-ritual.txt` is the verbatim transcript, also included in the homepage.
+
+Loading behavior
+================
+
+The hero poster is preloaded and its video requests metadata normally. Below-the-fold video and audio use `loading="lazy"` plus inert `data-poster` / `data-src` attributes and `preload="none"`. `media.js` restores URLs and metadata preloading once the player is within 200px of the viewport, then stops observing it. Using inert attributes from the initial HTML prevents the preload scanner from fetching posters before JavaScript runs, including in browsers without native media lazy loading. An older-browser fallback checks viewport distance on scroll and resize. No player autoplays. Download links and the transcript remain available without JavaScript.
